## `src/` — Source Projects

### `{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Common/`
Shared primitives and contracts. No external dependencies.

| Path | Contents |
|------|---------|
| `Primitives/Entity.cs` | Base class for domain entities (identity-based equality) |
| `Primitives/AggregateRoot.cs` | Base class for aggregate roots (domain event dispatch) |
| `Primitives/ValueObject.cs` | Base class for value objects (value-based equality) |
| `Primitives/IDomainEvent.cs` | Marker interface for domain events |
| `Primitives/ViewModelBase.cs` | Base class for WPF ViewModels (IsBusy, ErrorMessage) |
| `Contracts/` | Shared interfaces and contracts |
| `Utilities/` | Pure utility functions (no dependencies) |
| `Extensions/` | Extension methods |

### `{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Domain/`
Core business domain. **No external dependencies.** Zero references to infrastructure, WPF, or application concerns.

| Path | Contents |
|------|---------|
| `Entities/` | Domain entities and aggregate roots |
| `ValueObjects/` | Immutable value types |
| `Aggregates/` | Bounded context aggregate roots (complex aggregates) |
| `DomainEvents/` | Domain events raised by aggregates |
| `Repositories/` | Repository interfaces (implemented in Infrastructure) |
| `Services/` | Domain services (stateless domain logic across aggregates) |

### `{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Application/`
Use cases — CQRS commands, queries, handlers. Depends on Domain + Common only.

| Path | Contents |
|------|---------|
| `Commands/` | Write-side: `*Command.cs` records + handlers |
| `Queries/` | Read-side: `*Query.cs` records + handlers + DTOs |
| `Handlers/` | Cross-cutting handlers (if not co-located with commands/queries) |
| `DTOs/` | Data transfer objects returned from queries |
| `Behaviours/` | MediatR pipeline behaviors (validation, logging, performance) |
| `Ports/` | Application port interfaces (implemented in Infrastructure) |
| `DependencyInjection.cs` | Registers application services (MediatR, validators) |

### `{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Infrastructure/`
Persistence, external services, adapters. Implements ports from Application.

| Path | Contents |
|------|---------|
{{#if project.features.persistence}}
| `Persistence/` | EF Core DbContext, migrations, entity configurations |
{{/if}}
| `Repositories/` | Repository implementations using EF Core or other data access |
| `Adapters/` | External service adapters (file system, OS APIs, HTTP clients) |
| `DependencyInjection.cs` | Registers infrastructure services |

### `{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Presentation/`
WPF application. Entry point, views, viewmodels, resources.

| Path | Contents |
|------|---------|
| `App.xaml` / `App.xaml.cs` | Application entry point, DI host bootstrap |
| `Views/` | XAML files (`.xaml` + `.xaml.cs` code-behind) |
| `ViewModels/` | ViewModel classes using CommunityToolkit.Mvvm |
| `Resources/Theme.xaml` | UI theme configuration |
| `Resources/Colors.xaml` | Semantic color token definitions |
| `Converters/` | WPF value converters |

